    "body": "Would be nice to have.\r\n\r\nSomeone added this feature in their fork: https://github.com/Liam-Weitzel/mini.files/commit/e83282ca53c6021f1f4bfc214c4e566f0526b112\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n    copy_relative_path = 'ypr',\r\n    copy_absolute_path = 'ypa',\r\n    open_with_default = 'gx',\r\n    open_in_explorer = 'gX',\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Would be nice to have.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Someone added this feature in their fork: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/Liam-Weitzel/mini.files/commit/e83282ca53c6021f1f4bfc214c4e566f0526b112/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Liam-Weitzel/mini.files/commit/e83282ca53c6021f1f4bfc214c4e566f0526b112\">Liam-Weitzel/mini.files@<tt>e83282c</tt></a></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    copy_relative_path = 'ypr',\n    copy_absolute_path = 'ypa',\n    open_with_default = 'gx',\n    open_in_explorer = 'gX',\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">    <span class=\"pl-smi\">copy_relative_path</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>ypr<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">copy_absolute_path</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>ypa<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">open_with_default</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gx<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">open_in_explorer</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gX<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,</pre></div>",
