            "body": "Forking is not necessary:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/d74190c1528aaf12ba5f3a29d03524c6b81e18b3/doc/mini-files.txt#L516-L545\r\n\r\nThe fact that these keymaps are shown in the documentation implies that `mini.files` aims to stay as minimal as possible. As such, it's better to keep these keymaps in user space.\r\n\r\nAlso, I would prefer using `vim.ui.open` instead of calling `xdg-open`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/d74190c1528aaf12ba5f3a29d03524c6b81e18b3/doc/mini-files.txt#L535",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Forking is not necessary:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/d74190c1528aaf12ba5f3a29d03524c6b81e18b3/doc/mini-files.txt#L516-L545\">mini.nvim/doc/mini-files.txt</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 516 to 545\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/commit/d74190c1528aaf12ba5f3a29d03524c6b81e18b3\">d74190c</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L516\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"516\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC516\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-mh\"># Create mappings which use data from entry under cursor <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span></span> </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L517\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"517\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC517\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">  </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L518\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"518\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC518\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> Use <span class=\"pl-ms\">|</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">MiniFiles.get_fs_entry()</span><span class=\"pl-ms\">|</span>: &gt;lua </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L519\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"519\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC519\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">  </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L520\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"520\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC520\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">   -- Set focused directory as current working directory </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L521\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"521\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC521\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">   local set_cwd = function() </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L522\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"522\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC522\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     local path = (MiniFiles.get_fs_entry() or {}).path </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L523\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"523\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC523\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     if path == nil then return vim.notify('Cursor is not on valid entry') end </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L524\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"524\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC524\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     vim.fn.chdir(vim.fs.dirname(path)) </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"borde